comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-15T16:01:39.789Z",codex-sol,"Required checks verified: test (22), test (26), codeql. CodeQL remains unfiltered. Existing open CI item concerns release publishing and belongs to release work; no existing quick/deep or flaky-test item found, so create this Task. Preserve pinned action revisions and all release gates; docs path includes identity, changelog, package documentation and the release-caller docs contract. No release verifier or caller edits."
  "2026-11-15T16:04:17.357Z",codex-sol,"Baseline main run 43653414648: Node 26 execution 45m54s, Node 22 28m26s; creation-to-completion 114m25s and 154m31s. Largest full suites: schema boundaries 693.43s, transfers 160.63s, bindings 134.50s, mutation law 94.72s. Required CodeQL stays unfiltered. Typecheck and lint pass through pm test; helper tests and strict YAML parse pass. All product timeoutMs/budget and record-size assertions stay unscaled. Seeded batches use partial final batches with generated counts. Quick touched suites are running after a successful build. No full local test run."
